#: ../../tools/europepmc_citations_tools.rst:69
#: f34cef377e4f432fa88558d6a5884093
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get the reference list (bibliography) of a specific "
"paper from Europe PMC. Given a PubMed ID (PMID), returns all articles "
"cited BY that paper (its reference list). This is the reverse of "
"citations: instead of finding who cites a paper, find what papers it "
"cites. Essential for understanding a paper's intellectual foundations, "
"finding seminal works, and tracing research lineage. Use PMID from "
"EuropePMC search results."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/europepmc_citations_tools.rst:73
#: 58a9063077eb473b99164af799ff405f
msgid ""
"``pmid`` (string) (required) PubMed ID of the article whose references "
"you want. Examples: '25378148', '33234567', '29474920'. Find PMIDs using "
"Europe PMC search."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/europepmc_citations_tools.rst:79
#: d3a998c20033400bb4231bcdb8b04f13
